                <ul class="privacy-list mb-0">
                  <li>
                    Creating and maintaining user or
                    business accounts.
                  </li>

                  <li>
                    Processing orders and commercial
                    transactions.
                  </li>

                  <li>
                    Arranging delivery, fulfilment and
                    shipment tracking.
                  </li>

                  <li>
                    Communicating with you about orders,
                    accounts, support requests and services.
                  </li>

                  <li>
                    Providing customer support and resolving
                    disputes or service issues.
                  </li>

                  <li>
                    Maintaining platform security,
                    preventing fraud and investigating
                    suspicious or unauthorized activity.
                  </li>

                  <li>
                    Improving Kasyora's websites,
                    services, user experience and
                    operational processes.
                  </li>

                  <li>
                    Maintaining accounting, tax,
                    transaction and other records that
                    Kasyora is required or reasonably
                    entitled to maintain.
                  </li>

                  <li>
                    Meeting applicable legal,
                    regulatory and compliance obligations.
                  </li>
                </ul>

              </div>

            </div>

          </section>

        </div>


