                <p class="text-white-50">
                  Kasyora aims to process personal
                  information fairly, lawfully and in a
                  manner appropriate to the purpose for
                  which the information is required.
                </p>

                <p class="mb-0">
                  Depending on the circumstances, processing
                  may be necessary to provide requested
                  services, perform or prepare for a
                  transaction, comply with legal obligations,
                  protect legitimate interests, maintain
                  platform security, or take place with
                  consent where consent is required.
                </p>

              </div>

