                  <li>
                    Sellers, suppliers or fulfilment
                    participants where information is
                    necessary to complete an order.
                  </li>

                  <li>
                    Courier, shipping and logistics
                    providers.
                  </li>

                  <li>
                    Cloud infrastructure, hosting,
                    communications and technical
                    service providers.
                  </li>

                  <li>
                    Professional advisers, auditors
                    or service providers where
                    appropriately required.
                  </li>

                  <li>
                    Regulators, courts, law-enforcement
                    bodies or other authorities where
                    disclosure is required or permitted
                    by applicable law.
                  </li>

                </ul>

              </div>

            </div>

          </section>

        </div>


        <!-- =================================================
             7 COOKIES
             ================================================= -->
        <div class="col-12">

