                  remember preferences, support security
                  and understand how services are used.
                </p>

                <p class="mb-0">
                  Depending on the type of cookie and
                  applicable law, you may be able to manage
                  cookies through browser controls or
                  consent settings made available by Kasyora.
                  Disabling certain cookies may affect
                  functionality.
                </p>

              </div>

            </div>

          </section>

        </div>


        <!-- =================================================
             8 SECURITY
             ================================================= -->
        <div class="col-12">

          <section
            id="security"
            class="privacy-policy-section bg-white border-0 shadow-sm rounded-3 p-4 p-lg-5"
          >

            <div class="row g-4">

              <div class="col-12 col-lg-3">

                <span
                  class="badge bg-success rounded-pill px-3 py-2 mb-3"
                >
                  08
                </span>

                <h2 class="h3 fw-bold text-dark">
                  Information Security
                </h2>

              </div>


              <div class="col-12 col-lg-9">

                <p>
                  Kasyora uses administrative, technical
                  and operational safeguards intended to
                  protect personal information against
                  unauthorized access, loss, misuse,
                  alteration or disclosure.
                </p>

                <p>
                  Access to information should be limited
                  to people and service providers who
                  require it for legitimate operational
                  purposes and who are subject to
                  appropriate responsibilities.
                </p>

                <p class="mb-0">
                  No internet-connected system can be
                  guaranteed to be completely secure.
                  Users should therefore also protect
                  account credentials and notify Kasyora
                  if they believe an account or transaction
                  has been compromised.
                </p>

              </div>

            </div>

          </section>

        </div>


        <!-- =================================================
             9 DATA RETENTION
             ================================================= -->
        <div class="col-12">

