                  Data Retention
                </h2>

              </div>


              <div class="col-12 col-lg-9">

                <p class="mb-0">
                  Kasyora retains personal information
                  only for as long as reasonably necessary
                  for the purposes for which it was
                  collected, to provide services, resolve
                  disputes, maintain appropriate business
                  records, protect legal rights, prevent
                  fraud, or comply with applicable legal
                  and regulatory requirements.
                </p>

              </div>

            </div>

          </section>

        </div>


        <!-- =================================================
             10 INTERNATIONAL TRANSFERS
             ================================================= -->
        <div class="col-12">

          <section
